Appendix: Examples of Extracted Triples
Below are representative examples of triples extracted by our proposed method. For each example, the original Chinese task and its English translation are provided.
1. Relation: power_system_component_failure
(1)Input (Original): "电池电量耗尽导致引擎无法启动。" 
Output (Original): (电池电量耗尽, 动力系统部件故障, 引擎无法启动)
Input (Translation): "Battery power off leads to engine failure." 
Output (Translation): (Battery power off, power_system_component_failure, engine failure)

(2)Input (Original): "冷却液不足导致热管理系统报警。" 
Output (Original): (冷却液不足, 动力系统部件故障, 热管理系统报警)
Input (Translation): "Insufficient coolant triggers an alarm in the thermal management system." 
Output (Translation): (Insufficient coolant, power_system_component_failure, thermal management system alarm)

(3)Input (Original): "驱动电机控制器温度传感器故障，引发电机过热警告。" 
Output (Original): (驱动电机控制器温度传感器故障, 动力系统部件故障, 电机过热警告)
Input (Translation): "A fault in the drive motor controller's temperature sensor triggered a motor overheat warning." 
Output (Translation): (Drive motor controller temperature sensor fault, power_system_component_failure, motor overheat warning)

(4)Input (Original): "车载充电机内部模块损坏，无法进行交流充电。" 
Output (Original): (模块损坏, 动力系统部件故障, 交流充电失败)
Input (Translation): "Internal module damage in the on-board charger prevents AC charging." 
Output (Translation): (Module damage, power_system_component_failure, AC charging failure)

2. Relation: chassis_system_component_failure
(1)Input (Original): "轮胎压力不足是造成严重轮胎磨损的原因。" 
Output (Original): (轮胎压力不足, 底盘系统部件故障, 严重轮胎磨损)
Input (Translation): "The severe tire wear is due to insufficient tire pressure." 
Output (Translation): (Insufficient tire pressure, chassis_system_component_failure, severe tire wear)

(2)Input (Original): "悬挂系统空气弹簧漏气，导致车身高度异常。" 
Output (Original): (悬挂系统空气弹簧漏气, 底盘系统部件故障, 车身高度异常)
Input (Translation): "A leak in the suspension system's air spring caused abnormal vehicle body height."
Output (Translation): (Suspension air spring leak, chassis_system_component_failure, abnormal vehicle body height)

3. Relation: electrical_system_component_failure
