Input (Translation): "Severe depletion of the 12V battery caused some low-voltage appliances in the car to fail." 
Output (Translation): (12V battery depletion, electrical_system_component_failure, low-voltage appliance failure)

(2)Input (Original): "高压配电盒（PDU）接触器粘连，高压系统无法正常上电。" 
